      <title>只要 5 步驟！用 Midjourney 幫 Model 換衣服</title>
      <link>https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/midjourney-change-outfits/</link>
      <pubDate>Fri, 21 Apr 2023 18:20:06 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/midjourney-change-outfits/</guid>
      <dc:creator>林鼎淵</dc:creator>
      <category>AI 實戰</category>
      <description>難道外拍 Model 也受到 AI 衝擊要失業了嗎？今天這篇文章將會跟讀者分享如何用 Midjourney 幫 Model 換上指定服飾，並說明不同款式衣服會面臨的問題。</description>
      <media:content url="https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/midjourney-change-outfits/images/midjourney-change-outfits-og_hu_cc489a952001048e.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630" />
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>難道外拍 Model 也受到 AI 衝擊要失業了嗎？今天這篇文章將會跟讀者分享如何用 Midjourney 幫 Model 換上指定服飾，並說明不同款式衣服會面臨的問題。</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/midjourney-change-outfits/images/midjourney-change-outfits-01.webp" width="1144" height="619" alt="只要 5 步驟！用 Midjourney 幫 Model 換衣服（圖 1）" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></p>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>大綱

STEP 1：產生 Model 照片
STEP 2：產生衣服素材
STEP 3：透過任何工具將兩張圖片疊在一起（不用很精準）
STEP 4：將圖貼到 Ｍidjourney，並複製連結
STEP 5：幫 Model 換衣服
</code></pre><h2 id="step-1產生-model-照片">STEP 1：產生 Model 照片<a class="h-anchor" href="#step-1%e7%94%a2%e7%94%9f-model-%e7%85%a7%e7%89%87" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p>Prompt：「 <code>Full Body photograph of a Chinese female model standing in front of bright wall. High detail, 8k, bright &ndash;ar 9:16 &ndash;v 5</code>」</p>
<blockquote>
<p>中國 Model 的全身照片，站在亮麗的牆前面，高度細節、8k 畫質、圖片比例 9:16、Version 5</p>
</blockquote>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/midjourney-change-outfits/images/midjourney-change-outfits-02.webp" width="536" height="956" alt="STEP 1：產生 Model 照片（圖 2）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p>這邊我選擇「右上」的圖。</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/midjourney-change-outfits/images/midjourney-change-outfits-03.webp" width="536" height="956" alt="STEP 1：產生 Model 照片（圖 3）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<hr>
<h2 id="step-2產生衣服素材">STEP 2：產生衣服素材<a class="h-anchor" href="#step-2%e7%94%a2%e7%94%9f%e8%a1%a3%e6%9c%8d%e7%b4%a0%e6%9d%90" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p>Prompt：「<code>plain shirt in white background &ndash;v 5</code>」</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/midjourney-change-outfits/images/midjourney-change-outfits-04.webp" width="956" height="956" alt="STEP 2：產生衣服素材（圖 4）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p>Prompt：「<code>plaid shirt in white background &ndash;v 5</code>」</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/midjourney-change-outfits/images/midjourney-change-outfits-05.webp" width="956" height="956" alt="STEP 2：產生衣服素材（圖 5）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p>Prompt：「<code>cartoon logo shirt in white background &ndash;v 5</code>」</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/midjourney-change-outfits/images/midjourney-change-outfits-06.webp" width="956" height="956" alt="STEP 2：產生衣服素材（圖 6）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<hr>
<h2 id="step-3透過任何工具將兩張圖片疊在一起不用很精準">STEP 3：透過任何工具將兩張圖片疊在一起（不用很精準）<a class="h-anchor" href="#step-3%e9%80%8f%e9%81%8e%e4%bb%bb%e4%bd%95%e5%b7%a5%e5%85%b7%e5%b0%87%e5%85%a9%e5%bc%b5%e5%9c%96%e7%89%87%e7%96%8a%e5%9c%a8%e4%b8%80%e8%b5%b7%e4%b8%8d%e7%94%a8%e5%be%88%e7%b2%be%e6%ba%96" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p>你可以使用任何去背工具，這邊筆者是用：<a href="https://www.remove.bg/">https://www.remove.bg/</a></p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/midjourney-change-outfits/images/midjourney-change-outfits-07.webp" width="1400" height="579" alt="STEP 3：透過任何工具將兩張圖片疊在一起（不用很精準）（圖 7）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p>然後將兩張圖疊在一起，筆者用 PPT 無腦操作。</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/midjourney-change-outfits/images/midjourney-change-outfits-08.webp" width="1300" height="1154" alt="STEP 3：透過任何工具將兩張圖片疊在一起（不用很精準）（圖 8）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<hr>
<h2 id="step-4將圖貼到-midjourney並複製連結">STEP 4：將圖貼到 Midjourney，並複製連結<a class="h-anchor" href="#step-4%e5%b0%87%e5%9c%96%e8%b2%bc%e5%88%b0-midjourney%e4%b8%a6%e8%a4%87%e8%a3%bd%e9%80%a3%e7%b5%90" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/midjourney-change-outfits/images/midjourney-change-outfits-09.webp" width="993" height="655" alt="STEP 4：將圖貼到 Midjourney，並複製連結（圖 9）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<hr>
<h2 id="step-5幫-model-換衣服">STEP 5：幫 Model 換衣服<a class="h-anchor" href="#step-5%e5%b9%ab-model-%e6%8f%9b%e8%a1%a3%e6%9c%8d" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<p>先貼上連結，並將一開始的 Prompt 原封不動的貼到後面，最後記得要加上「 <code>&ndash;iw 2</code>」，將權重調到最高。</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/midjourney-change-outfits/images/midjourney-change-outfits-10.webp" width="1099" height="645" alt="STEP 5：幫 Model 換衣服（圖 10）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p>然後就換成功嚕！</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/midjourney-change-outfits/images/midjourney-change-outfits-11.webp" width="1400" height="2498" alt="STEP 5：幫 Model 換衣服（圖 11）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p>筆者目前實驗下來，素色的衣服最容易被吃進去；像是下面有格子狀的襯衫顏色不太穩定，且版型跟原圖有一定的差異。</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/midjourney-change-outfits/images/midjourney-change-outfits-12.webp" width="1400" height="2498" alt="STEP 5：幫 Model 換衣服（圖 12）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<p>如果是有圖案的衣服，那效果就更糟糕了，他有很大的機率變成其他圖案。</p>
<p><img src="https://deanlin.net/blog/202304/midjourney-change-outfits/images/midjourney-change-outfits-13.webp" width="1400" height="2498" alt="STEP 5：幫 Model 換衣服（圖 13）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></p>
<hr>
<h2 id="總結">總結<a class="h-anchor" href="#%e7%b8%bd%e7%b5%90" aria-label="這個段落的連結"></a></h2>
<ol>
<li>操作非常簡單，會用電腦的人都能操作。</li>
<li>如果衣服款式比較簡單，對人物姿勢沒有太大要求，那成功率上升很多。</li>
<li>如果衣服上有圖案、複雜細節，那產出來的結果幾乎不可控制。</li>
</ol>
<p>如果把 AI 產出來的圖拿來當商用素材（ex：電商平台），那可能會遇到一些細節不一致的問題，是有可能造成買賣糾紛的。</p>
<p>不過如果你把他當成「發想」的工具，那筆者覺得幫助就很大；像是服飾穿搭、顏色搭配、Model 姿勢…等等。</p>
<hr>
